---
layout: layouts/base.njk
fullTitle: "Manual Play ➣ Human-powered music discovery"
socialTitle: "Manual Play: Human-powered music discovery"
ownHeader: true
---
<main class="flex-1 pt-16 pb-20 sm:pt-24">
  <header class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
      {% set discSize = 96 %}{% set discClass = "size-24 rounded-[22px]" %}
      {% include "spin-disc.njk" %}

      {% include "nav-links.njk" %}
    </div>

    <h1 class="mt-10 max-w-2xl text-2xl leading-snug font-light text-pretty sm:text-3xl">
      <strong class="font-display font-bold uppercase [font-stretch:75%]">{{ site.name }}</strong> is a reader for new music. Subscribe to the blogs, websites, and newsletters you trust, and Manual Play turns their posts into a feed of releases that you can play with a single tap.
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-8">
      {% include "app-store-badge.njk" %}
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="features" class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl px-6 sm:mt-20" aria-label="Features">
    {% include "features-grid.njk" %}
  </section>

  <section class="mt-16 sm:mt-20" aria-label="Screenshots">
    {% include "screenshots-carousel.njk" %}
  </section>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl px-6 sm:mt-20">
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-2xl leading-snug font-light text-pretty sm:text-3xl">
      <strong class="font-display font-bold uppercase [font-stretch:75%]">{{ site.name }}</strong> is free and donation-supported.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-5">
      {% include "app-store-badge.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

